msgstr "Klikněte do místa středu strany. Klávesa Esc operaci zruší."

#: crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs:5142
msgid "Click where the next run ends: which way it turns from the landing, and how far it goes. Past its top, it takes the risers left."
msgstr ""

